<section class="panel form-panel"><div class="section-kicker">YOUTH THANKSGIVING SERVICE</div><h2>One offering. A clear split.</h2><p class="muted">The total offering is always <strong>100%</strong>. Set the portion removed for the church to retain; the balance is what the church pays into the provincial account. Changes apply only to future reports.</p><form method="post" id="allocation-form" class="form-grid"><?php hiddenAction('allocation_settings') ?><label>Total offering baseline<input value="100%" readonly aria-label="Total offering baseline is 100 percent"></label><label>Church retention / deduction (%)<input name="retained_percentage" id="retained-percentage" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="<?= e(Money::decimal(10000-(int)setting($db,'levy_basis_points'))) ?>" required></label><div class="calculated"><span>Church pays to the province</span><strong id="payable-percentage"><?= e(Money::decimal((int)setting($db,'levy_basis_points'))) ?>%</strong></div><div class="notice small">Example: retaining 20% means the church pays 80%. For a ₦100,000 offering, ₦20,000 stays with the church and ₦80,000 goes to the province.</div><h3 class="full-width">Provincial receiving account</h3><label>Bank name<input name="bank_name" value="<?= e(setting($db,'provincial_bank_name')) ?>" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Account name<input name="account_name" value="<?= e(setting($db,'provincial_account_name')) ?>" required maxlength="150"></label><label>Account number<input name="account_number" value="<?= e(setting($db,'provincial_account_number')) ?>" required pattern="[0-9]{10}" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="10"></label><label>Public officer registration<select name="registration_enabled"><option value="1" <?= setting($db,'registration_enabled')==='1'?'selected':'' ?>>Open — registrations require admin approval</option><option value="0" <?= setting($db,'registration_enabled')==='0'?'selected':'' ?>>Closed</option></select></label><button class="primary">Save percentages &amp; receiving account →</button></form></section><?php endif ?>

